<section id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">AUROC Analysis for Divergence Prediction.</h5>

<div id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ AUROC Analysis for Divergence Prediction. ‣ 5.2 Prediction at Initialization ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Residual Koopman Spectral Profiling for Predicting and Preventing Transformer Training Instability" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> compares spectral predictors against gradient baselines. We use the monotone risk score <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{\approx 1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{\approx 1}</annotation></semantics></math> for divergence prediction. This achieves an AUROC of 0.995 at initialization, representing a 31% relative improvement over the best gradient-based method with an AUROC of 0.758. The superiority is statistically significant: the 95% CI lower bound of <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{\approx 1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{\approx 1}</annotation></semantics></math> of 0.986 exceeds the upper bounds of all gradient-based methods.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>AUROC for divergence prediction with bootstrap 95% confidence intervals. The <math id="S5.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{\approx 1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{\approx 1}</annotation></semantics></math> CI lower bound of 0.986 exceeds gradient baselines’ upper bounds. Measured on the associative-recall normalization sweep.</figcaption>
<div id="S5.T2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:100.9pt;vertical-align:-48.4pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-36.2pt,10.6pt) scale(0.826648673619047,0.826648673619047) ;">
<table id="S5.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S5.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<th id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.6pt 4.5pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">Predictor</span></th>
<th id="S5.T2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.6pt 4.5pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">AUROC (higher)</span></th>
<th id="S5.T2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.6pt 4.5pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">95% CI</span></th>
<th id="S5.T2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.6pt 4.5pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">Timing</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.6pt 4.5pt;"><math id="S5.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" alttext="M_{\approx 1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathbackground="#FFFFFF">M</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathbackground="#FFFFFF">≈</mo><mn style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathbackground="#FFFFFF">1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{\approx 1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.T2.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;"> at initialization</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.6pt 4.5pt;"><math id="S5.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" alttext="\mathbf{0.995}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathbackground="#FFFFFF" mathvariant="bold">0.995</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{0.995}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.6pt 4.5pt;"><math id="S5.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" alttext="[0.986,1.000]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathbackground="#FFFFFF" stretchy="false">[</mo><mn style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathbackground="#FFFFFF">0.986</mn><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathbackground="#FFFFFF">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathbackground="#FFFFFF">1.000</mn><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathbackground="#FFFFFF" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0.986,1.000]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.6pt 4.5pt;"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">Initialization</span></td></tr>
